From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles <y28688120@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:35:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ssh): allow slow tunnel readiness without reconnect loops

Keep upstream retry and route synchronization behavior. Give SSH preparation 120 seconds and forwarded HTTP probes 15 seconds within a 60-second create/reuse window. Retain the 1-second remote loopback probe and direct/relay budgets.
---
